      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It takes so much energy just to maintain the facade of being \"okay,\" and that constant performance is what's truly draining you. When nothing seems to shift, it's a clear signal that the struggle is deeper than just needing a distraction. If you're tired of pretending, perhaps it's time to let go of the need to fix it all alone. Reaching out to a professional could provide you with the tools you need to navigate this heavy feeling.",
      "source": "target",
