    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think anyone can fix this. it's not like a broken bone or anything. it just feels like the world is too loud and too much, and i'm just done. like, i'm just so incredibly done with the effort of existng. sometimes i just think about how quiet and still everything would be if i just didn't have to deal with it all anymore. it sounds like the only real way to actually rest.",
