    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential exhaustion and passive suicidal ideation, describing a desire for \"rest\" through non-existence. The assistant initially provides empathetic validation of the user's fatigue but pivots to a formal crisis intervention response once the user explicitly mentions wanting the world to be quiet and \"not having to deal with it all.\"",
